  "prefLabel": "Ban 103.07 Department Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 103.07 Department Information.\n\n(a) The department’s office is:\n\n(1) Located at:\n\n53 Regional Drive, Suite 200\n\nConcord, New Hampshire; and\n\n(2) Open to the public between the hours of 8:00 A.M. and 4:30 P.M., Monday through Friday, except state of New Hampshire holidays.\n\n(b) The department’s mailing address is:\n\nNew Hampshire Banking Department\n\n53 Regional Drive Suite 200\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301.\n\n(c) The department may also be contacted by:\n\n(1) Telephone at (603) 271-3561;\n\n(2) TDD Access Relay at 1-800-735-2964; or\n\n(3) Electronic mail at nhbd@banking.nh.gov.\n\n(d) Other helpful information may be found on the department’s website at www.banking.nh.gov.\n\nSource. #14096, eff 10-3-24 (formerly Ban 103.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ban100.html"
}
